{{Term/Store|Sapphire Circlet|Sapphire Circlets|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

{{TOC|limit= 3}}

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
Sapphire Circlets are a type of [[Circlet]] [[Accessory]] that is worn as head [[Armor]].<ref name="BotW Book"/> They can be purchased in the [[Starlight Memories]] [[Jewelry Shop]] in [[Gerudo Town]]. They cost 800 [[Rupee]]s and three [[Sapphire]]s to buy.<ref name="BotW Isha"/> Alternatively, at the end of the "[[Tools of the Trade]]" [[Side Quest]], one of the Accessories that [[Isha]] offers to make [[Link]] as a reward is a Sapphire Circlet.<ref name="BotW Isha 2"/><ref name="BotW Isha 3"/> When worn, they provide Link with one level of [[Heat Resistance]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They also provide the hidden [[Added Effect]] [[Ancient Pow Up]], increasing damage done by [[Ancient Soldier Gear]] and [[Guardian Gear]] by 20%.

Sapphire Circlets can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]. However, they cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

